    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Musketeer's Advance",
      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The musketeer is wielding a flintlock musket\n\n---\nEffect The musketeer makes a flintlock musket Strike. If the Strike hits, the target is Off-Guard to melee attacks by the musketeer until the end of the musketeer's next turn. Regardless of whether the Strike hit, the musketeer then Interacts to swap their flintlock musket for their rapier and Strides toward the creature they attacked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "One for All",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The musketeer is wielding a single one-handed weapon in one hand and has their other hand free\n\n---\nEffect The musketeer grants a +1 circumstance bonus to AC to themself until the start of their next turn. Allies also gain this bonus while adjacent to the musketeer. If a creature would benefit from more than one creature's One for All ability, the bonus is +2 instead of +1.\n\nEffect: One for All"
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Sneak Attack",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The musketeer deals an extra 1d6 precision damage to Off-Guard creatures.",
