  ],
  "text": "Flashy and confident, the musketeer isn't above using dirty tricks to gain the upper hand in a fight. Despite their bravado, musketeers are fiercely loyal to their allies.\n\n---\nThese lone wolves have an aura of mystery, bravado, and swagger."
